#undef NDEBUG
// Review HF: the families of /api/mine keyed by a typed attribute on an XES
// upload's log shape (read_xes' legacy log object).
//
// - Alpha, the transition system, the log skeleton and the temporal profile
//   name their activities by the objects the importer stores (ints of any
//   width, floats with each NaN its own object, booleans, dates in UTC with
//   their wall clock kept, None for a valueless value); an event without the
//   key raises KeyError where a family reads it, a list with children
//   TypeError unhashable; the Alpha net's token replay with the key replays
//   the same objects.
// - The Inductive miner sorts the activity set (TypeError operands in the
//   set's order), mines None alone as a tau or fails networkx, and its
//   tree's str() fails on the first leaf that is no str, the leaves in the
//   order Python sorts their values.
// - Heuristics++ reads the key event by event (KeyError, unhashable dict),
//   or with a start column every start first (KeyError 'start_timestamp'),
//   compares labels as Python does, and its Petri conversion fails on the
//   first node visited whose value is no str with an incoming edge; the
//   token replay with the key replays the same objects.
// - Declare keyed by such a key with an empty str value collapses its
//   binary rules onto the act (pm4py's falsy test), on the log shape and
//   the DataFrame shapes alike.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-hf: tc/mkhf.py, ct/xesfam.py, ct/dcx.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_hf_tests <minera_server>
